   "entry": "PUT Statement",
   "document": "stmt",
   "category": "CAS",
   "type": "Executable",
   "valid_in": "DATA step",
   "disposition": "GATED",
   "rule_ids": [
    "DS-023",
    "DS-024",
    "DS-025",
    "DS-027"
   ],
   "gates": [
    "put-literal",
    "suite-put",
    "put-character-list",
    "suite-put-list",
    "put-all",
    "suite-put-all",
    "put-numeric-list",
    "suite-put-numeric"
   ],
   "reference_page": 265,
   "note": "Bounded logical records of quoted literals and ordinary unformatted nonblank character variables: printable ASCII, at most 64 columns including variable separators, documented spacing and quote decoding. Blank fields, numeric output, attached formats, special controls, literal adjacency/comment-only separation, FILE, pointers, macros, and C++ require review. Named-list output has a separate entry. DS-025 adds bounded scalar PUT _ALL_: ordered named PDV fields, ordinary numeric missing and conservative BEST12 integers, _ERROR_=0 and _N_=1. No general error-flag or physical SAS log equivalence. DS-027 separately gates source-order known numeric variables: ordinary missing and finite integers with magnitude at most 99999999999, one following separator per field, at most 64 logical columns. Types and attached formats are validated even on empty or filtered SET input; mixed numeric items, unknown/descriptor-only variables, fractions, special missing output, formats, controls, and C++ retain refusals."
  },
